    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Sherry FitzGerald Fogarty are delighted to offer this perfectly presented and cared for home for sale at Glentara, Roscrea. Set on an elevated site, this detached bungalow is a wonderful home for someone starting out in life or sitting back to relax. Built in 1970, it has large gardens front & rear with plenty of parking, a tarmacadamed driveway, and two garden sheds. Accommodation comprises an entrance hall, a living room with solid fuel stove and back boiler, kitchen/dining, three bedrooms and a family bathroom. Two bedrooms have built in wardrobes and the kitchen units are a recent addition to the house. Decor is perfect with no outlay required. The location is within walking distance of Roscrea town centre and all local amenities, and this is a quiet residential district. The property is connected to all mains services and heated by oil fired central heating and solid fuel back boiler.The west facing rear garden is perfect for family entertaining. This is an easily maintained and managed home. Viewing recommended, please call Julie Fogarty 0505 21192."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Porch - 1.56m x .66m\n\n\nEntrance Hall - 1.73mx 3.17m\n\n\nLiving Room - 3.42m x 4.43m\n\n\nKitchen - 3.40m x 2.47m\n\n\nDining Room - 3.91m x 1.83m\n\n\nHall - .90m x 5.51m\n\n\nBedroom 1 - 2.88m x 2.83m\n\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.41m x 2.81m\n\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.85m x 2.85m\n\n\nBathroom - 1.66m x 1.97m"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>OFCH & solid fuel central heating.</li><li>Double glazed windows throughout.</li><li>Tarmacadam drive and back yard.</li><li>Steel storage shed.</li><li>Mains water and sewerage.</li><li>Efibre broadband available.</li><li>High grade insulation, internally and externally.</li></ul>"
      },
